  "description": "A .NET wrapper for mq — a jq-like tool for querying and transforming Markdown. Extract headings, code blocks, paragraphs, and links using a fluent API (Mq.Query(\".h(1)\").On(markdown).Run()) or a reusable MqEngine. Supports Markdown, HTML, and plain-text inputs. Cross-platform: Windows, Linux, and macOS (x64 and ARM64).",
